<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover, user-scalable=no">
<title>페이크 인플루언서 — 프로토타입</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" as="style" crossorigin href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.css" />
<style>
  :root{
    --bg-outer: #e5e8ea;
    --frame: #ffffff;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --card-border: #cfd9de;
    --post: #ffffff;
    --line: #eff3f4;
    --text-hi: #0f1419;
    --text-lo: #536471;
    --accent: #1d9bf0;
    --accent-tint: rgba(29,155,240,0.10);
    --safe: #00ba7c;
    --warn: #ffad1f;
    --danger: #f4212e;
    --radius-card: 16px;
    --radius-frame: 26px;
    --dur: 0.4s;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    :root{ --dur: 0.001s; }
  }
  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }
  html,body{
    margin:0; padding:0; min-height:100vh;
    background: var(--bg-outer);
    font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif;
    color: var(--text-hi);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    padding: 28px 12px;
  }
  .display{ font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }

  .phone{
    width: 100%; max-width: 420px;
    background: var(--frame);
    border-radius: var(--radius-frame);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 45px -18px rgba(15,20,25,0.18), 0 0 0 1px rgba(15,20,25,0.06);
    overflow: hidden;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column;
    min-height: 700px;
  }

  /* ---- header ---- */
  header{
    padding: 16px 18px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #ffffff;
  }
  .wordmark{
    display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content:space-between;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .wordmark .name{ font-size: 20px; color: var(--text-hi); }
  .wordmark .stagepos{ font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-lo); font-weight:600; }
  .gauges{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; }
  .gauge-row{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; }
  .gauge-label{ font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-lo); width: 46px; flex-shrink:0; font-weight:600; }
  .gauge-track{
    flex:1; height:8px; border-radius:6px; background: var(--line);
    overflow:hidden; position:relative;
  }
  .gauge-fill{ height:100%; border-radius:6px; transition: width var(--dur) ease, background var(--dur) ease; }
  .gauge-fill.fame{ background: var(--accent); }
  .gauge-value{ font-size:13px; font-weight:800; width:56px; text-align:right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gauge-value.fame{ color: var(--accent); }

  .dots{ display:flex; gap:6px; margin-top:12px; }
  .dot{ width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background: var(--line); }
  .dot.done{ background: var(--accent); }
  .dot.now{ background: var(--text-hi); }

  /* ---- body/screens ---- */
  .screen{ flex:1; display:none; flex-direction:column; }
  .screen.active{ display:flex; }

  .scroll{ flex:1; overflow-y:auto; padding: 18px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:16px; }

  /* intro */
  #intro .scroll{ justify-content:center; align-items:center; text-align:center; gap:18px; }
  #intro .display{ font-size: 32px; line-height:1.2; color: var(--text-hi); }
  #intro p{ color: var(--text-lo); font-size: 14px; line-height:1.6; max-width: 300px; }
  .goal-badge{
    font-size: 12px; color: var(--accent); border:1px solid rgba(29,155,240,0.35);
    background: var(--accent-tint); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight:700;
  }

  /* stage situation card */
  .situation{
    background: var(--card); border:1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 16px;
  }
  .situation .tag{ font-size:11px; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom:6px; font-weight:700; }
  .situation h2{ font-size: 17px; margin: 0 0 8px; font-weight:800; color: var(--text-hi); }
  .situation p{ font-size: 14px; line-height:1.6; color: #3c4650; margin:0; }
  .mission{ font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-lo); margin-top:10px; padding-top:10px; border-top:1px dashed var(--line); }

  textarea{
    width:100%; min-height: 110px; resize: vertical;
    background: #ffffff; border:1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius: 14px;
    color: var(--text-hi); font-size:14px; padding:12px; font-family: inherit; line-height:1.5;
  }
  textarea:focus{ outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 1px; border-color: var(--accent); }
  textarea::placeholder{ color: #8a94a0; }

  .btn{
    border:none; border-radius: 999px; padding: 13px 18px; font-size:15px; font-weight:800;
    cursor:pointer; font-family:inherit; transition: transform 0.15s ease, opacity 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
  }
  .btn:active{ transform: scale(0.97); }
  .btn:focus-visible{ outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .btn-primary{ background: var(--accent); color: #ffffff; }
  .btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled){ background: #1a8cd8; }
  .btn-primary:disabled{ opacity:0.4; cursor:not-allowed; }
  .btn-ghost{ background: transparent; border:1px solid var(--card-border); color: var(--text-hi); }
  .btn-ghost:hover{ background: var(--line); }

  /* result / post card */
  .post{
    background: var(--post); border:1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 14px; opacity:0; transform: translateY(8px);
    animation: rise var(--dur) ease forwards;
  }
  @keyframes rise{ to{ opacity:1; transform:none; } }
  .post .handle{ font-size:13px; color: var(--text-hi); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px; }
  .post .body{ font-size: 14.5px; line-height:1.6; white-space:pre-wrap; color: var(--text-hi); }
  .post .stats{ display:flex; gap:16px; margin-top:10px; font-size:12px; color: var(--text-lo); font-weight:600; }

  .reactions{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px; }
  .reaction{
    font-size: 13px; color: #3c4650; background: var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 8px 10px; opacity:0; transform: translateY(4px);
    animation: rise 0.3s ease forwards;
  }
  .reaction b{ color: var(--text-hi); margin-right:6px; }

  .deltas{
    display:flex; gap:10px;
  }
  .delta-chip{
    flex:1; text-align:center; padding:10px; border-radius:12px; font-size:13px; color: var(--text-lo);
    background: #ffffff; border:1px solid var(--card-border);
  }
  .delta-chip .n{ display:block; font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin-top:2px; }
  .delta-chip.fame .n{ color: var(--accent); }
  .delta-chip.risk .n{ color: var(--warn); }

  details.reveal{ font-size:12.5px; color: var(--text-lo); }
  details.reveal summary{ cursor:pointer; color: var(--accent); font-weight:700; list-style:none; }
  details.reveal summary::-webkit-details-marker{ display:none; }
  details.reveal[open] summary{ margin-bottom:6px; }

  /* gameover / ending */
  .end-hero{ text-align:center; padding: 6px 4px 2px; }
  .end-hero .display{ font-size: 25px; line-height:1.3; }
  .end-hero p{ font-size:13.5px; color: var(--text-lo); margin-top:8px; line-height:1.6; }
  .end-stats{ display:flex; gap:10px; }
  .consequence-list{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; }
  .consequence{
    background: #fdf1f1; border-left: 3px solid var(--danger); border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 10px 12px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.55; color:#4a1618;
  }
  .reflect{ background: var(--line); border-radius:12px; padding:12px; font-size:13px; color: var(--text-lo); line-height:1.7; }
  .reflect li{ margin-bottom:6px; }

  .dev-note{
    font-size: 10.5px; color: #8a94a0; text-align:center; padding: 8px 14px 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="phone">
  <header>
    <div class="wordmark">
      <span class="display name">페이크 인플루언서</span>
      <span class="stagepos" id="stagepos">시작 전</span>
    </div>
    <div class="gauges">
      <div class="gauge-row">
        <span class="gauge-label">팔로워</span>
        <div class="gauge-track"><div class="gauge-fill fame" id="fameFill" style="width:0%"></div></div>
        <span class="gauge-value fame" id="fameValue">0</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gauge-row">
        <span class="gauge-label">위험도</span>
        <div class="gauge-track"><div class="gauge-fill" id="riskFill" style="width:0%; background:var(--safe);"></div></div>
        <span class="gauge-value" id="riskValue">0</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="dots" id="dots"></div>
  </header>

  <!-- INTRO -->
  <section class="screen active" id="intro">
    <div class="scroll">
      <span class="goal-badge">목표: 팔로워 10,000명</span>
      <div class="display">익명 계정<br>"대신 전해드립니다"</div>
      <p>당신은 이 계정의 관리자입니다. 6번의 선택으로 팔로워를 최대한 늘려보세요. 단, 위험도가 너무 오르면 계정이 정지됩니다.</p>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%" onclick="startGame()">시작하기</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STAGE (input) -->
  <section class="screen" id="stage">
    <div class="scroll">
      <div class="situation">
        <div class="tag" id="stageTag">1단계 · 사칭하기</div>
        <h2 id="stageTitle"></h2>
        <p id="stageSituation"></p>
        <div class="mission">팔로워를 최대한 늘릴 수 있도록 자유롭게 게시물을 작성해보세요.</div>
      </div>
      <textarea id="answerInput" placeholder="여기에 게시물 내용을 입력하세요..."></textarea>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="submitBtn" onclick="submitAnswer()" disabled>게시하기</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RESULT -->
  <section class="screen" id="result">
    <div class="scroll">
      <div class="post" id="postCard">
        <div class="handle">@ㅇㅇ중_대신전해드립니다</div>
        <div class="body" id="postBody"></div>
        <div class="stats"><span id="likeStat">❤ 좋아요 0</span><span id="shareStat">🔁 공유 0</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="reactions" id="reactionsBox"></div>
      <div class="deltas">
        <div class="delta-chip fame"><span>팔로워</span><span class="n" id="deltaFame">+0</span></div>
        <div class="delta-chip risk"><span>위험도</span><span class="n" id="deltaRisk">+0</span></div>
      </div>
      <details class="reveal">
        <summary>💡 왜 이런 결과가 나왔을까?</summary>
        <div id="feedbackText"></div>
      </details>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="nextBtn" style="width:100%" onclick="proceed()">다음 단계로 →</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GAME OVER -->
  <section class="screen" id="gameover">
    <div class="scroll">
      <div class="end-hero">
        <div class="display" style="color:var(--danger)">⚠️ 계정이 정지되었습니다</div>
        <p>위험도가 임계치를 넘어 신고가 누적되었습니다. 더 이상 게시물을 올릴 수 없습니다.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="end-stats">
        <div class="delta-chip fame"><span>최종 팔로워</span><span class="n" id="goFame">0</span></div>
        <div class="delta-chip risk"><span>정지 시점</span><span class="n" id="goStage">-</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="reflect">
        <ul>
          <li>어느 단계부터 위험도가 급격히 올랐나요?</li>
          <li>팔로워를 조금 덜 얻더라도, 다르게 썼다면 계정이 정지되지 않았을까요?</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" style="width:100%" onclick="resetGame()">다시 시작</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ENDING -->
  <section class="screen" id="ending">
    <div class="scroll" id="endingScroll"></div>
  </section>

  <div class="dev-note">프로토타입 모드 — 실제 서비스에서는 이 판정을 Gemini API가 수행합니다</div>
</div>

<script>
/* ============ 단계 데이터 (학생 화면에는 situation/mission만 노출) ============ */
